@startuml 03_test_setup
title Week-3 test loop: bandwidth sweep with tc and logging
skinparam shadowing false
start
:systemd starts FFmpeg (3 renditions, 1 s segments);
:Open player page (?sync=3), start logging;
:tc_steps.sh: none -> 5M -> 2.5M -> 1.2M -> 0.7M -> 1.2M -> 2.5M -> 5M -> none\n(60 s each, 9 min);
fork
  :monitor.sh every 2 s\nCPU of ffmpeg, temperature, throttled, free RAM;
fork again
  :Player logs every second\nlevel, estimate, buffer, latency, stalls;
end fork
:tc_steps.sh prints "limit removed on wlan0";
:Download CSV logs;
:Python model abr_sim.py replays the log;
:Compare switch times, stalls, latency;
stop
@enduml
